  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Scan class feature, ability to cast Detect Magic</p><p>The blue mage gains the benefits of Detect Magic whenever they use the Scan class feature, but only for that creature. Scanning a different target stops this effect on the first. If the blue mage has the Improved Scan azure talent, she can benefit from Detect Magic against a number of creatures equal to her Intelligence modifier. Selecting this a second time treats the blue mage as if she has spent 3 rounds inspecting the targets.</p>",
